  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mass Valuation project (DELEF), Lantm&#xe4;teriet</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Massv&#xe4;rderingsprojekt (DELEF), Lantm&#xe4;teriet</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Impact objective:

All citizens and organizations in BiH access and benefit from transparent, fair, and democratic services based on accurate land, real estate and geospatial information provided by the Geodetic Authorities in cooperation with key stakeholders. 

Outcome objectives per component:

Overall Capacity Development: Geodetic Agencies (GAs) are modern, transparent and efficient organizations contributing to economic and social development in close cooperation with stakeholders involved in land administration in BiH.

Mass Valuation: GAs contribute to a transparent property market by managing a real estate mass valuation system to benefit all citizens and the business community.

Spatial Data Infrastructure (SDI): GAs and other spatial data providers enable service-based sharing of up-to-date and accurate spatial data used by stakeholders to face and resolve sustainable development challenges.

Geodetic Infrastructure: The accurate, reliable, and easily accessible geodetic infratructure is globally integrated and used by all stakeholders.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Detta projekt &#xe4;r utvecklat gemensamt av Federal Administration for Geodetic and Real Property Affairs (FGA) i Bosnien och Hercegovina (FBiH), Republic Authority for Geodetic and Property Legal Affairs (RGA) i Republika Srpska (RS) och Lantm&#xe4;teriet i samarbete med Skatteverket.

De f&#xf6;rv&#xe4;ntade resultaten av projektet &#xe4;r:
&#xd6;vergripande kapacitetsutveckling: GA &#xe4;r moderna, transparenta och effektiva organisationer som bidrar till ekonomisk och social utveckling i n&#xe4;ra samarbete med intressenter som &#xe4;r involverade i markf&#xf6;rvaltningen i Bosnien och Hercegovina.

Massv&#xe4;rdering: GA bidrar till en transparent fastighetsmarknad genom att hantera ett massv&#xe4;rderingssystem f&#xf6;r fastigheter till nytta f&#xf6;r alla medborgare och n&#xe4;ringslivet.

Spatial Data Infrastructure (SDI): GA och andra rumsliga dataleverant&#xf6;rer m&#xf6;jligg&#xf6;r tj&#xe4;nstebaserad delning av aktuell och korrekt rumslig data som anv&#xe4;nds av intressenter f&#xf6;r att m&#xf6;ta och l&#xf6;sa utmaningar inom h&#xe5;llbar utveckling.

Geodetisk infrastruktur: Den exakta, p&#xe5;litliga och l&#xe4;ttillg&#xe4;ngliga geodetiska infrastrukturen &#xe4;r globalt integrerad och anv&#xe4;nds av alla intressenter.
.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project is developed jointly by Federal Administration for Geodetic and Real Property Affairs (FGA) of the Federation of Bosnia and Herzegovina (FBiH), Republic Authority for Geodetic and Property Legal Affairs (RGA) of the Republika Srpska (RS) and Lantm&#xe4;teriet, The Swedish Mapping, Cadastral and Land Registration Authority in cooperation with the Swedish Tax Agency. 

The expected outcomes of the project are:
Overall Capacity Development: GA are modern, transparent and efficient organiza-tions contributing to economic and social development in close cooperation with stake-holders involved in land administration in BiH.

Mass Valuation: GA contribute to a transparent property market by managing a real estate mass valuation system to benefit all citizens and the business community.

Spatial Data Infrastructure (SDI): GA and other spatial data providers enable service-based sharing of up-to-date and accurate spatial data used by stakeholders to face and resolve sustainable development challenges.

Geodetic Infrastructure: The accurate, reliable, and easily accessible geodetic infra-structure is globally integrated and used by all stakeholders.</narrative>
  </description>
